 "latex_table": "\\begin{table*}[t]\n\\centering\n\\small\n\\caption{Ablation study of MALRG components (mean over 10 topics; best in bold).}\n\\label{tab:ablation}\n\\resizebox{\\textwidth}{!}{\\begin{tabular}{lccccccccc}\n\\toprule\n\\textbf{Configuration} & \\textbf{Citation Groundedness} $\\uparrow$ & \\textbf{Citation Precision} $\\uparrow$ & \\textbf{Hallucination Rate} $\\downarrow$ & \\textbf{Fabricated Reference Rate} $\\downarrow$ & \\textbf{Source Coverage} $\\uparrow$ & \\textbf{Multi-Source Synthesis} $\\uparrow$ & \\textbf{Verified Gap Precision} $\\uparrow$ & \\textbf{Judge: Overall (1-10)} $\\uparrow$ & \\textbf{Grounded Quality Index (GQI)} $\\uparrow$ \\\\\n\\midrule\nM0: Vanilla LLM (no retrieval) & 6.1 & 5.5 & 82.4 & 46.9 & 0.0 & 0.9 & 15.5 & 3.67 & 22.2 \\\\\nM1: Retrieval + Writer & 21.1 & 21.6 & 78.3 & \\textbf{0.0} & 98.0 & 13.6 & 62.0 & 6.90 & 50.5 \\\\\nM2: w/o Cross-Paper Synthesis & 24.4 & 23.3 & 71.5 & 0.0 & \\textbf{100.0} & 9.8 & 78.0 & 7.70 & 55.1 \\\\\nM3: w/o Adversarial Verification & 24.4 & 19.4 & 69.9 & 0.0 & 86.0 & \\textbf{29.6} & 84.7 & 7.67 & 56.4 \\\\\nM4: Full Multi-Agent Pipeline & 22.6 & 20.8 & 72.7 & 0.0 & 98.0 & 21.5 & 88.0 & \\textbf{7.90} & 57.0 \\\\\nM5: Full + Verification-Guided Feedback (Proposed) & \\textbf{49.7} & \\textbf{45.9} & \\textbf{58.9} & 0.0 & 98.0 & 21.4 & \\textbf{90.5} & 7.38 & \\textbf{64.8} \\\\\n\\bottomrule\n\\end{tabular}}\n\\end{table*}\n"
